  "knownLimits": [
    "DOC/DOCX, XLS/XLSX and PPT/PPTX semantic import/edit/write and conversions remain M2/M3/M4 and mandatory legacy sub-milestones.",
    ".oex is an internal JSON draft, not an Office format; drafts with unbundled resource payloads are rejected.",
    "Canvas grapheme positions are estimated; no Office layout, pagination, shaping or formula-calculation accuracy claim.",
    "Composition tests simulate DOM events; physical native IMEs and full accessibility/manual keyboard coverage remain unverified.",
    "Native dialog responses are supplied by the harness; system file-picker interaction was not manually exercised.",
    "Process-exit and injected-IO checks are not literal machine power-cut or storage-controller certification.",
    "Portable Node cannot make rename conditional on the last observed inode; final external-writer race and filesystem-specific directory-sync limits remain documented.",
    "Windows Server 2025 CI is not a Windows 10/11 installer certification; Intel macOS and other Linux distributions were not run.",
    "The Windows settings symlink test is skipped explicitly; do not count it as passed.",
    "Network policy and negative request tests are not an OS-level packet-capture audit; exact-version dependency review remains ongoing."
  ],
